## 5. External Interface Requirements

### 5.1 API Endpoints (indicative — finalize in architecture.md)
| Method | Path | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/sessions` | Create a new session |
| GET | `/sessions` | List sessions |
| GET | `/sessions/{id}` | Get session history |
| POST | `/sessions/{id}/chat` | Send a message; returns assistant reply (+ source attribution + artifact if produced). Supports streaming (SSE) where the active provider allows it. |
| GET | `/artifacts/{id}` | Fetch a specific artifact |
| GET | `/config/providers` | List available/active LLM providers |
| POST | `/config/providers` | Set active provider |

### 5.2 Data Model (indicative)
```
sessions(id, title, created_at, llm_provider, embedding_model)
messages(id, session_id, role, content, skill_used, routing_intent, sources_json, created_at)
artifacts(id, message_id, type[markdown|html], content, version, created_at)
transcript_chunks(id, episode_title, chunk_index, chunk_text, embedding, source_url)
```

### 5.3 UI Requirements
- Chat pane: message list, input box, session selector/new-session control, provider indicator/toggle.
- Artifact pane: renders current artifact type-appropriately; hidden/collapsed when no artifact is active for the current turn.

