## 8. Open Questions / Decisions to Finalize During Implementation
- Retrieval method: vector embeddings (requires an embedding model/API) vs. lexical (BM25) — affects dependency footprint.
- Corpus size: full repository vs. representative subset for the local demo.
- Session title generation: LLM-generated vs. simple truncation of first message.
- Artifact versioning: overwrite-in-place vs. full version history exposed in UI.